  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 12 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLocated within the top tier school zones of Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Schools. \r\n\r\nAfter several decades, this much-loved immaculately presented family home presents an opportunity for your next chapter, in a sought-after neighbourhood. \r\n\r\nEnjoy the Sunrise! Enjoy the view! \r\n\r\nWith the seascape as your backdrop winding down from your day has just become that much more enjoyable.\r\nNaturally bright, warm and welcoming. Designed across split levels with practical separation of living, dining and bedroom areas, giving families room to come together while still enjoying their own space. \r\n\r\nFor added flexibility, the downstairs level has separate access, which is great for teenagers and guests and includes a lock up double garage plus off-street parking.\r\n\r\nTucked off the road, the surrounding greenery creates a peaceful retreat and a wonderful sense of seclusion. \r\nThe generous 945m² (more or less) garden provides plenty of room to enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nDiscover the best of coastal living with the Mairangi Bay's shops, cafes and beach just down the road.",
